      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>An El Malé Raḥamim prayer for Victims of Terror in Erets Yisrael, with an English translation by Rabbi Hillel Ḥayyim Lavery-Yisraeli from <tei:hi rend="italic">Prayers for Israel, for Protection from Terror Attacks, and In Memory of the Victims</tei:hi> (15 October 2023), page 6. The girsah of the prayer appearing here was slightly adapted from the version found at Hebrew Wikipedia’s article on Yom haZikaron. We are uncertain as to the origins and original author of this adaptation of El Malé Raḥamim — if you know, please leave a comment (or contact us).</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
